}

docs {
  ## Signup — Missing Required Fields

  Sends only `name` without `email`, `password`, `student_id`, or `department`.

  ### Expected Response (400)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "error": "Email, password, and name are required"
  }
  ```
}
